{
  "name": "reception-system",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "大規模イベント(来場者 1,000 人以上想定)向けの**受付と整理券管理を Web で完結させるシステム**。来場者はスマホで整理券を取得し、運営は QR スキャンで効率的に捌く。HMD(VR ヘッドセット)体験を含むブースを運営する想定。",
  "main": "index.js",
  "directories": {
    "doc": "docs"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test:e2e": "playwright test",
    "test:e2e:ui": "playwright test --ui",
    "test:e2e:push": "playwright test e2e/tests/notification-push.spec.ts",
    "test:e2e:polling": "playwright test e2e/tests/notification-polling.spec.ts",
    "test:e2e:template": "playwright test e2e/tests/notification-template.spec.ts"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/saitoomoo/reception-system.git"
  },
